  "goodToKnow": "Der Sonnenschein is sunshine: bei strahlendem Sonnenschein (in glorious sunshine). It's also a term of endearment for a cheerful person, often a child: Na, mein Sonnenschein? Weather reports talk about die Sonnenscheindauer (hours of sunshine). Der Schein means light or shine, and also appearance or a banknote. Nach Regen kommt Sonnenschein means every cloud has a silver lining."
